>>
endobj
258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 140 0 R
/T (After the 2021 edition ran entirely online because of COVID-19, Formula  Bharat returned to Kari Motor Speedway in 2022 with a hybrid format. Static events like Business Plan, Cost and Manufacturing, and Engineering Design were judged online, followed by on-track dynamic events such as skidpad, acceleration, endurance, and autocross. That year drew 45 combustion and 25 electric teams across the online and on-site legs. In the years since, funding diversified into sponsorships, workshops, and memberships, and the community grew to over 20,000 students and 1,000 volunteers.)
/E (After the 2021 edition ran entirely online because of COVID-19, Formula  Bharat returned to Kari Motor Speedway in 2022 with a hybrid format. Static events like Business Plan, Cost and Manufacturing, and Engineering Design were judged online, followed by on-track dynamic events such as skidpad, acceleration, endurance, and autocross. That year drew 45 combustion and 25 electric teams across the online and on-site legs. In the years since, funding diversified into sponsorships, workshops, and memberships, and the community grew to over 20,000 students and 1,000 volunteers.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 140 0 R
/T (Formula Bharat marked its 10th edition in January 2026 at Kari Motor Speedway, drawing over 60 teams from 19 Indian states, alongside a co-located Indian Hardware Startup Meet featuring 14 deep-tech startups. Formula Bharat remains the only Formula Student event in South Asia recognised by the Formula Student World Rankings.)
/E (Formula Bharat marked its 10th edition in January 2026 at Kari Motor Speedway, drawing over 60 teams from 19 Indian states, alongside a co-located Indian Hardware Startup Meet featuring 14 deep-tech startups. Formula Bharat remains the only Formula Student event in South Asia recognised by the Formula Student World Rankings.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 140 0 R
/T (Formula Bharat has always been sold as more than a race, a direct response to India's graduate-employability problem, which the Economic Survey 2024 pegged at just over 51 per cent. That shows up in its alumni too: people from the competition now work at Ather Energy, Exponent Energy, and Tesla. Less than a decade after its first, shoestring edition, Formula Bharat has become South Asia's benchmark Formula Student competition!)
/E (Formula Bharat has always been sold as more than a race, a direct response to India's graduate-employability problem, which the Economic Survey 2024 pegged at just over 51 per cent. That shows up in its alumni too: people from the competition now work at Ather Energy, Exponent Energy, and Tesla. Less than a decade after its first, shoestring edition, Formula Bharat has become South Asia's benchmark Formula Student competition!)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
