282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (Founded in 2016 by Murali Srinivasa, Lion Circuits set out to fix a problem every young Indian engineer knew too well: getting a circuit board made was slow, expensive, and buried in paperwork. Their self-service platform launched in 2017, and within a few years had grown to serve thousands of makers and automotive customers across the country.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (That growth is now taking its most ambitious shape yet in Terra Circuits, a 100-acre integrated manufacturing campus coming up in Vijayapura, Karnataka. The vision is simple: bring PCB fabrication, assembly, component sourcing, and box-build under one roof, cutting what is usually a weeks-long, multi-vendor process down to a 24-hour turnaround. It's the kind of ground-up infrastructure India's electronics ecosystem has long needed, and Lion Circuits is betting on itself to build it.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (As a student-led mobility team striving to push the boundaries of design and performance, we draw inspiration from organisations that build the tools they wish existed, and back them with the infrastructure to scale.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (We would like to thank Lion Circuits for their trust and confidence in our team. With their support, we look forward to enhancing our engineering capabilities and continuing our journey towards innovation, excellence, and mobility.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
