1961 0 obj
<<
/Title (After the 2021 edition ran entirely online because of COVID-19, Formula  Bharat returned to Kari Motor Speedway in 2022 with a hybrid format. Static events like Business Plan, Cost and Manufacturing, and Engineering Design were judged online, followed by on-track dynamic events such as skidpad, acceleration, endurance, and autocross. That year drew 45 combustion and 25 electric teams across the online and on-site legs. In the years since, funding diversified into sponsorships, workshops, and memberships, and the community grew to over 20,000 students and 1,000 volunteers.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1953 0 R
/Next 1965 0 R
>>
endobj
1962 0 obj
<<
/Title (Formula Bharat has always been sold as more than a race, a direct response to India's graduate-employability problem, which the Economic Survey 2024 pegged at just over 51 per cent. That shows up in its alumni too: people from the competition now work at Ather Energy, Exponent Energy, and Tesla. Less than a decade after its first, shoestring edition, Formula Bharat has become South Asia's benchmark Formula Student competition!)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1953 0 R
/Prev 1965 0 R
>>
endobj
